 <name>MComix</name>
 <summary>Comic and general purpose image viewer</summary>
 <description>
  <p>
	  MComix is a user-friendly, customizable image viewer. It is specifically
	  designed to handle comic books (both Western comics and manga) and supports
	  a variety of container formats (including CBR, CBZ, CB7, CBT, LHA and PDF).
  </p>
  <p>
	  This is a hard fork of MComix 3.2.0. It adds optional GPU neural
	  upscaling of small pages, animated WebP playback, on-demand reading of
	  archive pages, AVIF and SVG pages, and many bug fixes.
  </p>
 </description>

